{"id":627,"name":"rufflet","speciesId":627,"dex":627,"form":"normal","generation":5,"types":["normal","flying"],"stats":{"hp":70,"attack":83,"defense":50,"special-attack":37,"special-defense":50,"speed":60},"abilities":[{"name":"keen-eye","hidden":false},{"name":"sheer-force","hidden":false},{"name":"hustle","hidden":true}],"height":5,"weight":105,"baseExp":70,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/627.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/627.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/627.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/627.ogg","genus":"Eaglet Pokémon","flavor":[{"version":"omega-ruby","text":"They crush berries with their talons. They bravely stand up to any opponent, no matter how strong it is."},{"version":"white","text":"They will challenge anything, even strong opponents, without fear. Their frequent fights help them become stronger."},{"version":"black-2","text":"It stands up to massive opponents, not out of courage, but out of recklessness. But that is how it gets stronger."},{"version":"sun","text":"They pick fights indiscriminately. They grow stronger and more powerful each time they faint or are injured."},{"version":"moon","text":"With its sharp claws, this Pokémon pierces its prey, and then it pecks at them. Although it also consumes berries, it’s a carnivore at heart."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"With its powerful legs and sturdy claws, it can crack even the hard shells of Shellder and pluck out their insides."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"Known as a natural-born warrior, soon after its hatching, it will challenge its parent to a fight in order to gain their acceptance."},{"version":"sword","text":"If it spies a strong Pokémon, Rufflet can’t resist challenging it to a battle. But if Rufflet loses, it starts bawling."},{"version":"shield","text":"A combative Pokémon, it’s ready to pick a fight with anyone. It has talons that can crush hard berries."},{"version":"legends-arceus","text":"Its chick-like looks belie its hotheadedness. It challenges its parents at every opportunity, desperate to prove its strength."}],"genderRate":0,"captureRate":190,"eggGroups":["flying"],"isLegendary":false,"isMythical":false,"evolution":{"species":"rufflet","speciesId":627,"evolvesTo":[{"conditions":["Nível 54","Nível 54"],"species":"braviary","speciesId":628,"evolvesTo":[]}]},"varieties":[{"id":627,"name":"rufflet","form":"normal","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/627.png"}],"games":[11,14,15,16,17,18,20,24,25],"moves":[{"id":15,"learn":[[11,"tm",0],[14,"tm",0],[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0]]},{"id":17,"learn":[[11,"lv",10],[14,"lv",10],[15,"lv",10],[16,"lv",10],[17,"lv",10],[18,"lv",10],[20,"lv",12],[25,"lv",12]]},{"id":18,"learn":[[11,"lv",55],[14,"lv",55],[15,"lv",55],[16,"lv",55],[17,"lv",55],[18,"lv",55],[20,"lv",42],[25,"lv",42]]},{"id":19,"learn":[[11,"tm",0],[14,"tm",0],[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0],[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0],[20,"tm",0],[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":31,"learn":[[11,"lv",5],[14,"lv",5],[15,"lv",5],[16,"lv",5],[17,"lv",5],[18,"lv",5]]},{"id":34,"learn":[[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":36,"learn":[[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":37,"learn":[[11,"lv",64],[14,"lv",64],[15,"lv",64],[16,"lv",64],[17,"lv",64],[18,"lv",64],[20,"lv",66],[25,"lv",66]]},{"id":38,"learn":[[24,"lv",34],[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":43,"learn":[[11,"lv",1],[14,"lv",1],[15,"lv",1],[16,"lv",1],[17,"lv",1],[18,"lv",1],[20,"lv",1],[25,"lv",1]]},{"id":64,"learn":[[11,"lv",1],[14,"lv",1],[15,"lv",1],[16,"lv",1],[17,"lv",1],[18,"lv",1],[20,"lv",1],[25,"lv",1]]},{"id":70,"learn":[[11,"tm",0],[14,"tm",0],[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0]]},{"id":92,"learn":[[11,"tm",0],[14,"tm",0],[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0],[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0]]},{"id":97,"learn":[[20,"tm",0],[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":98,"lea